### Pruebas de seguridad (Fase 3) - Spring Security + BCrypt + JWT
### Uso:
###   - VS Code: extensión "REST Client" (hucha.rest.vscode-rest-client) -> clic en "Send CodeLens" sobre cada bloque
###   - IntelliJ IDEA: plugin "HTTP Client" -> clic en el icono de la flecha verde de cada bloque
###   - Variables a definir al inicio (ajustar si cambiaste la clave JWT):
###     @baseUrl  = http://localhost:8080
###     @token    = (pegar aqui el token devuelto por POST /auth/login)
###     @tokenRec = (pegar aqui el token de recepcion@cfc.edu.sv)
###
### Para obtener los tokens, ejecuta primero los bloques "1. LOGIN" y "2. LOGIN RECEPCIONISTA"
### y copia el valor de "token" en las variables de arriba.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token =
@tokenRec =

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. LOGIN ADMIN -> emite el token JWT (200)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cfc.edu.sv",
  "password": "Admin123*"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. LOGIN RECEPCIONISTA -> token con rol distinto (200)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recepcion@cfc.edu.sv",
  "password": "Recepcion123*"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. LOGIN con contrasena incorrecta -> 401 Unauthorized
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cfc.edu.sv",
  "password": "clave-mala"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Endpoint protegido SIN token -> 401 Unauthorized
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Endpoint protegido CON token ADMIN -> 200 OK
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Administration de usuarios con token ADMIN -> 200 OK
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Administration de usuarios con token RECEPCIONISTA -> 403 Forbidden
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRec}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Token invalido / alterado -> 401 Unauthorized
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/clientes
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbkBjZmMuIn0.firma-falsa

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Datos de la sesion actual -> 200 OK
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Crear usuario (la contrasena se guarda cifrada con BCrypt) -> 201 Created
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Usuario de prueba",
  "email": "prueba.http@cfc.edu.sv",
  "password": "Prueba123*",
  "rolId": 3,
  "estado": true
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Login con el usuario recien creado -> 200 OK (confirma el hash BCrypt)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba.http@cfc.edu.sv",
  "password": "Prueba123*"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. Documentacion publica (sin token) -> 200 OK
### ---------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
